  "slug": "halliday-payments",
  "name": "Halliday Payments",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A Clade Code plugin for development with Halliday Payments, the all-in-one platform for integrating crypto deposits, fiat-to-crypto onramps, and cross-chain swaps.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `halliday-payments` (Integrates Halliday Payments for crypto deposits, fiat-to-crypto onramps, and cross-chain swaps) and **1 hook**, `PreToolUse`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install halliday-payments@claude-community` from `HallidayInc/HallidayClaudePlugin`.\n\nA Claude Code plugin that gives Claude the context it needs to help developers integrate Halliday Payments (crypto deposits, fiat-to-crypto onramps, cross-chain swaps).",
